{"id":"3e36e5f6179c1fad","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-algebra2-quotient-ring.md","title":"ZFC Algebra2 Quotient Ring","display":"df-zfc-algebra2-quotient-ring — ZFC Algebra2 Quotient Ring","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-quotient-ring","aliases":["58-df-zfc-algebra2-quotient-ring"],"display":"df-zfc-algebra2-quotient-ring — ZFC Algebra2 Quotient Ring","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-ring]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-equivalence-relation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-quotient-ring"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-algebra2-quotient-ring</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-algebra2-quotient-ring — ZFC Algebra2 Quotient Ring"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"58-df-ring\">58-df-ring</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"58-df-equivalence-relation\">58-df-equivalence-relation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ring}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ring}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2QuotientRing}_S\\subseteq V^{12}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2QuotientRing}_S\\subseteq V^{12}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,R,I,+_R,\\cdot_R,-_R,0_R,1_R,+_Q,\\cdot_Q,0_Q,1_Q\\in V\">\\(Q,R,I,+_R,\\cdot_R,-_R,0_R,1_R,+_Q,\\cdot_Q,0_Q,1_Q\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ring}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Ring}_S\\)</span> (unital-ring predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"58-df-ring\">58-df-ring</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2QuotientRing}_S:V^{12}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2QuotientRing}_S:V^{12}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}ring}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2QuotientRing}_S(Q,R,I,+_R,\\cdot_R,-_R,0_R,1_R,+_Q,\\cdot_Q,0_Q,1_Q)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(-_R,R,R)\n\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\bigl(+_R(r,-_R(r))=0_R=+_R(-_R(r),r)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land I\\subseteq R\\land0_R\\in I\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;\\bigl(+_R(a,-_R(b))\\in I\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall a\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\cdot_R(r,a)\\in I\\land\\cdot_R(a,r)\\in I\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nE=\\{\\langle r,s\\rangle\\in R^2:+_R(r,-_R(s))\\in I\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,R)\n\\land Q=\\{[r]_E:r\\in R\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{53pt}\\land\\operatorname{Function}(+_Q,Q\\times Q,Q)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\cdot_Q,Q\\times Q,Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{53pt}\\land\\forall r,s\\in R\\;\\Bigl(\n+_Q([r]_E,[s]_E)=[+_R(r,s)]_E\n\\land\\cdot_Q([r]_E,[s]_E)=[\\cdot_R(r,s)]_E\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{53pt}\\land0_Q=[0_R]_E\\land1_Q=[1_R]_E\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}ring}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2QuotientRing}_S(Q,R,I,+_R,\\cdot_R,-_R,0_R,1_R,+_Q,\\cdot_Q,0_Q,1_Q)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(-_R,R,R)\n\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\bigl(+_R(r,-_R(r))=0_R=+_R(-_R(r),r)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land I\\subseteq R\\land0_R\\in I\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;\\bigl(+_R(a,-_R(b))\\in I\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall a\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\cdot_R(r,a)\\in I\\land\\cdot_R(a,r)\\in I\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nE=\\{\\langle r,s\\rangle\\in R^2:+_R(r,-_R(s))\\in I\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,R)\n\\land Q=\\{[r]_E:r\\in R\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{53pt}\\land\\operatorname{Function}(+_Q,Q\\times Q,Q)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\cdot_Q,Q\\times Q,Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{53pt}\\land\\forall r,s\\in R\\;\\Bigl(\n+_Q([r]_E,[s]_E)=[+_R(r,s)]_E\n\\land\\cdot_Q([r]_E,[s]_E)=[\\cdot_R(r,s)]_E\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{53pt}\\land0_Q=[0_R]_E\\land1_Q=[1_R]_E\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ideal condition is the two-sided ring-ideal condition; it is not the downward-closed set ideal from 58-df-ideal.  The additive inverse is now tied to the ring, the congruence is an actual relation set, and both quotient operations are typed functions.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ring","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ring]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equivalence-relation","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-equivalence-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ring","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ring}_S$ (unital-ring predicate, see [[58-df-ring]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ring}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2QuotientRing}_S\\subseteq V^{12}","display":false},{"tex":"Q,R,I,+_R,\\cdot_R,-_R,0_R,1_R,+_Q,\\cdot_Q,0_Q,1_Q\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ring}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2QuotientRing}_S:V^{12}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}ring}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2QuotientRing}_S(Q,R,I,+_R,\\cdot_R,-_R,0_R,1_R,+_Q,\\cdot_Q,0_Q,1_Q)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(-_R,R,R)\n\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\bigl(+_R(r,-_R(r))=0_R=+_R(-_R(r),r)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land I\\subseteq R\\land0_R\\in I\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;\\bigl(+_R(a,-_R(b))\\in I\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall a\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\cdot_R(r,a)\\in I\\land\\cdot_R(a,r)\\in I\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nE=\\{\\langle r,s\\rangle\\in R^2:+_R(r,-_R(s))\\in I\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,R)\n\\land Q=\\{[r]_E:r\\in R\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{53pt}\\land\\operatorname{Function}(+_Q,Q\\times Q,Q)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\cdot_Q,Q\\times Q,Q)\\\\\n&\\hspace{53pt}\\land\\forall r,s\\in R\\;\\Bigl(\n+_Q([r]_E,[s]_E)=[+_R(r,s)]_E\n\\land\\cdot_Q([r]_E,[s]_E)=[\\cdot_R(r,s)]_E\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{53pt}\\land0_Q=[0_R]_E\\land1_Q=[1_R]_E\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2088,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1429","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-algebra2-quotient-ring.md|58-df-zfc-algebra2-quotient-ring]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","1c30d21ea7b443f6","36d7463d215be751","908bc7b079f5d25b"]}